Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白 好小！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:13.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有过跟小空一样小的时候哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:17.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要看再长大一点的照片？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:18.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看是哪一本...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这个小姑娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是蝶华姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.27,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不是我们刚认识时候的照片啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:38.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,刚开始的时候 小白特别怕生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:40.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一跟你搭话 就变得扭扭捏捏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:45.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小时候的事情了 记不太清楚了 应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:46.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:49.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩是什么时候开始变成好朋友的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我也想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:51.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那应该是在...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:00:59.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:01.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我还记得这棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就是在这里确立关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:08.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们结交的契机 究竟是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这关键的地方 具体的我也想不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:18.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,再去这里一趟 说不定就能想起来了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:20.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也想去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:25.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:29.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}两个人是好朋友♡ 回忆的大树！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.81,0:03:20.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.01,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,山真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这叫做红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:30.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你们回忆中的大树 到底在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:34.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说吧 具体的地方我也记不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,上次来还是很久以前了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.27,0:03:39.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候我更小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:45.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟由由阿姨打听了一下 她跟我说...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:50.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,“你们自己去找吧 就像寻宝一样 会更有趣哦”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:52.53,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,寻宝很有趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:53.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:57.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,先到今天留宿的节子阿婆家里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:04:01.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,上次来也受她关照 说不定知道点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华和真白都长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:16.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,唐突叨唠 真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就喜欢热闹 小朋友们也热烈欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:30.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:33.02,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,咯咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,咯咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,想起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:45.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次来这里的时候 也在这里喝过茶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:50.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,节子阿婆 你知道这棵树吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？是哪棵啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:05:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有印象 具体的位置就不知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:02.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:05.47,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,树 找不到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,正要开始找呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:10.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们四处逛逛 边散步边找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:12.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.49,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,散步！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那把阿白也带上吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:21.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿白？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:26.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶... 那啥...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:27.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿白是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,雪白雪白的 眼睛圆溜溜的 很可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.55,0:05:35.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为是小狗呢 吓了我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:37.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:39.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:45.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,散步 散步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.21,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,和阿白一起散步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:01.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有的地方跟以前不一样了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这条路有来过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:07.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是说 那棵树肯定就在前方！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:08.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:10.74,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:12.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,秋千！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:17.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主 我知道你很想玩 现在就忍一忍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:22.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,作为交换 等找到了那棵树 我陪你一起玩秋千 玩到舒畅...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:23.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:25.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼 等会再玩！忍住！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不是啊 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:37.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 等等我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,找到现在都没找到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这一带还有印象吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次大概没有来过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:25.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:28.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是真美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:36.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 这里是跟大伙一起找到的 新的回忆的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:46.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 啊 帽子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:48.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:08:00.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候 好像也是帽子...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:02.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:07.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,在最后发现了关键线索呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:11.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咩 咩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等会请教我做法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然就是个普通的家常菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要找的是回忆里的那课树吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:41.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:43.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经找到线索了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:45.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,渐渐地回想了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:51.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候也是去散步 然后我的帽子被风吹跑了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:57.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶帮我去追
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,帽子不停地飞...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,挂到了那棵树上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:18.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 后来的事情就想不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:21.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我们究竟发生了什么故事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:26.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是小蝶姐想办法拿到了帽子 拉近了你们的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:31.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,但是照片里的真白没有戴帽子啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:33.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:38.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:40.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没有注意到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,诶嘿诶嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:50.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,帽子还挂在树上 你们怎么就变要好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帽子...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个哪个...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这棵树 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道在哪里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道是知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:26.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,节子阿婆告诉我们的 就是这里了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:30.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是昨天第一个来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:33.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:43.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,跟节子阿婆说的一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那棵树被去年的台风吹断了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:53.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到痕迹就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:11:01.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 那时候的事情也都想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真白妹妹 我帮你去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:25.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:27.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:29.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:31.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:32.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:35.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:37.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 没事 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶 很痛痛的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:46.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,去医院吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:53.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你看我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:54.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:00.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:08.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠们是不是很喜欢帽子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:10.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:15.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:26.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么 我其实想跟小蝶你交朋友的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经是朋友了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:32.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我以后能叫你小白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:36.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:47.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟小蝶就是这样拍下了那张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（快门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:54.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢你让我们结交
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,还要感谢松鼠们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（吱吱 吱吱）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:02.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那个秋千就是用这棵树做成的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:07.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对松鼠们来说 这棵树肯定也是宝贵的回忆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:08.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:13.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起兴奋不已 心动不止 像寻宝一样找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:16.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,留下了很多很多宝贵的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:17.87,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,回忆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那大伙一起拍张照吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.35,0:13:23.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:30.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吱吱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那我拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:47.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,5 4 3 2 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:47.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:48.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,1...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:50.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（快门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:51.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:57.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:04.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:18.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！居然追到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:20.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们宝贵的地方啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:22.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:23.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
