Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:24.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:26.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶凶 凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:28.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好快！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:31.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这枪法 有点难应付！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:39.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,正面攻击的确强 但是相对的 两侧就有破绽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:44.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:45.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:49.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:50.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:54.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:55.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:16:58.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:02.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,她们两个 随着战斗的增加 越来越默契了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:08.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:12.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:15.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:16.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:20.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,背后！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:24.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:28.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.39,0:17:31.13,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing 谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:39.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,很想现在就展开反击的 但需要有个对策来处理那枪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:44.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧 大伙想办法压制住它的行动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:54.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！凶！凶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:55.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:57.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing的配合也相当默契了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:02.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也来！加入一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:05.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:07.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:07.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:09.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:09.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:16.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,温度的力量 给你降降温！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:20.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶 凶凶...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.73,0:18:22.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！机会来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:24.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
