Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:45.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要盯着我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.01,0:20:48.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没有知道的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:51.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我清楚就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:08.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真开心啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:12.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还跟大伙留下了新的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.67,0:21:13.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:16.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看看别的照片吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:21.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:24.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是那个时候的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.34,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 怪脸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.75,0:21:28.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是少年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:29.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:31.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐也是有够怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:34.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学也很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:37.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴也是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:41.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这也算是美好的回忆吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:51.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还想跟大伙一起去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:59.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等到那个时候 我和那棵回忆的树
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:03.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都会长得比现在更大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:09.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:09.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,960)}天空愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:13.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家和我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.35,0:23:50.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 晴朗宝石的光芒消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:52.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,晴朗宝石？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.65,0:23:55.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,据说没有了那个光芒 大家都会很困扰的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:57.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 我们去调查一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:23:58.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.85,0:24:01.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.85,0:24:01.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.54,0:24:04.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救蓝天！浮岛的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:32.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.44,0:01:38.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:43.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:51.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:56.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:02:00.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.18,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:06.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:11.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:17.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:21.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:24.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:27.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:27.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:32.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:37.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:42.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:47.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:58.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
